WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:09.920
Mom loves her independence. And you love knowing she's doing okay. But when you live hours away, it's hard to know how her day is really going.

2
00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:20.280
So every weekday, at the time you choose, her caregiver appears right on her TV. No tablet. No app. Nothing to answer.

3
00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:26.830
It's a real Caring Companions caregiver, someone who gets to know her and her routines.

4
00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:34.820
When it's time for her morning medication, her caregiver reminds her, and stays on the call while she takes it herself.

5
00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:41.370
They ask about breakfast and her plans, and notice how she looks and sounds.

6
00:00:42.670 --> 00:00:49.360
And then they just talk. For a lot of families, this turns out to be the part that matters most.

7
00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:54.420
And you hear how she's doing, the way you and our team agree on.

8
00:00:55.720 --> 00:01:03.850
It all runs on HomeTogether TV, a small hub with a privacy shutter over the camera. And your family can video call her, too.

9
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:11.400
[Price: weekday check-ins from $75 a week (15 minutes) or $125 a week (30 minutes), Monday to Friday, plus HomeTogether TV $99 a month. TV included with 20+ private-pay hours a week of in-home care. Optional cellular $35 a month. Not an emergency alert service.]

10
00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:17.860
Someone checks in on Mom every weekday, even when you can't be there. Caring Companions.

